#import "../template.typ": somatic_page

// PHASE 3 - PAGE 20: TRIGGERS & PROJECTIONS - PROMPTS
// Mirroring technique + Mad-lib structured prompts per Shadow Work Philosopher

#somatic_page(
  title: "The Mirror Work",
  body_text: [
    Bring to mind someone who truly irritates you. Notice what happens in your body: perhaps a flush of heat, a clenching jaw, or a tightening in your chest. This activation is your shadow waving—asking to be recognized.
    
    #v(0.5cm)
    
    #set text(style: "italic", size: 10.5pt)
    
    *1. The person who triggers me most right now is* __________.
    
    The quality in them that bothers me is __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *2. Now, turn the mirror inward. Complete honestly:*
    
    A place where I also have this quality (even secretly) is __________.
    
    I show this quality when I __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *3. If I owned this quality consciously instead of projecting it, I would* __________.
    
    The energy I would reclaim is __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
  ],
  image_path: none,
  layout_style: "bottom"
)
